# Canonical per-repo rally ledger. Append-only across all worktrees and
# branches. `merge=union` makes git concatenate both sides on merge instead
# of producing a conflict — which is the correct behavior for an
# append-only event log: the merged file is the union of all events
# anyone has ever recorded. Rally tolerates duplicate lines on replay
# (dedup by sequence_number), so this is safe.
.rally/ledger.jsonl merge=union
